      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgeton%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first floor of Bridgeton’s Italianate building originally housed a drug store.",
